**Findings**
- MUST-FIX: `src/cli/commands/batch.ts:215`  
  Adding `batch commands` introduces a nested `batch ...` leaf command, but validation still only special-cases `found.name === "batch"`. Repro: `kspec batch --dry-run --commands '[{"command":"batch commands","args":{}}]' --json` returns the generic mutating-only rejection instead of the dedicated nested-batch rejection (`@batch-allowed-commands ac-batch-itself`).
- SHOULD-FIX: `tests/batch-commands.test.ts:151`  
  Missing regression test for nested `batch commands` inside batch input asserting the dedicated nested-batch rejection message.

